WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:03.041
The ribosome has three spots: E, P,

00:00:03.145 --> 00:00:03.714
and A.

00:00:04.341 --> 00:00:06.222
New tRNAs always come in at the

00:00:06.292 --> 00:00:06.837
A site.

00:00:07.371 --> 00:00:08.985
Each one carries an amino acid.

00:00:09.438 --> 00:00:10.680
Here's one that doesn't match.

00:00:11.214 --> 00:00:13.385
Its anticodon doesn't pair, so it leaves.

00:00:14.012 --> 00:00:15.022
Here's one that does.

00:00:15.649 --> 00:00:17.472
It pairs with the codon and stays.

00:00:18.006 --> 00:00:19.435
Like a key that only fits its

00:00:19.481 --> 00:00:20.120
own lock.

00:00:20.746 --> 00:00:22.534
A charged tRNA enters at the A

00:00:22.639 --> 00:00:24.752
site and stays if its anticodon matches

00:00:24.798 --> 00:00:25.414
the codon.

00:00:26.412 --> 00:00:27.085
Swipe.
